  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "實用真空技術",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL VACUUM TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "台灣在在全球半導體、顯示器、LED與太陽能等產業都佔有非常關鍵的地位，這些產業的製程設備超過一半屬於真空設備。本課程將介紹真空基礎知識並說明真空技術如何使用在各種不同的設備上，同時也會對真空系統常用的重要元件如壓力計、流量計與真空泵等做更詳細介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "Taiwan holds a very crucial position in global industries such as semiconductors, displays, LEDs, and solar energy, with more than half of the process equipment in these industries being vacuum equipment. This course will introduce the basics of vacuum technology and explain how vacuum technology is applied in various types of equipment. Additionally, the course will provide a detailed introduction to important components commonly used in vacuum systems, such as pressure gauges, flow meters, and vacuum pumps.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
